# BLOODCLOT: KNOB BANK turns the pads from the desk to the drums (pads 1-8 DRUM's sounds, 9-16 HAND's) and back; on
# SEQ's Steps page the pads are the bar's steps unless the drums are on; the riddim is there in a new project
wait 300
listen
expect pads_drums 0
expect note 1 1 9 1
expect note 2 1 1 33
expect note 3 1 3 57
expect tempo 75
smktap KNOBBANK
wait 60
said PADS DRUMS
expect pads_drums 1
expect drumhits 0
tappad 0 100
expect drumhits 1
tappad 12 100
expect drumhits 2
expect mute 0
expect thrown 0
smktap KNOBBANK
wait 60
said PADS DESK
expect pads_drums 0
# the desk again: a pad drops, no drum
tappad 0 100
wait 60
expect mute 1
expect drumhits 2
tappad 0 100
wait 60
expect mute 0
# SEQ: the selected channel's steps on the pads
tap SEQ
wait 60
expect page Steps
tappad 1 100
wait 60
expect mute 0
shot bc_steps
